WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.146
Welcome to Engineering Quest, where math powers your adventure.

2
00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:14.030
Every day starts at Home. Your tasks are here: review, new math, then a weak spot.

3
00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:21.911
Press GO and the game takes you to the next thing to do.

4
00:00:21.971 --> 00:00:31.896
On the Quest map, you travel from Arithmetic Village all the way to calculus.

5
00:00:31.956 --> 00:00:38.505
Monsters block the road. Answer math questions to beat them.

6
00:00:38.565 --> 00:00:47.561
Right answers are hits. A miss lets you try again, or learn the trick first.

7
00:00:47.621 --> 00:00:56.617
The Arcade has games to train with: drills, Equation Plaza, the Dice Workshop and more.

8
00:00:56.677 --> 00:01:04.382
The Library holds every lesson, academy and how-to video, ready to replay.

9
00:01:04.442 --> 00:01:09.690
And Me shows your progress, your badges and your gear.

10
00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.330
Ready, engineer? Your quest starts now!
